  "notes": "The Windows server is not run in a container anywhere in this repository: the runtime image is recorded only because the schema requires one, and runtime verification is off for this connector. TakaroAsa.dll is compiled with MSVC toolset 14.44 on GitHub's windows-2022 runner, because AsaApi's headers and AsaApi.lib target MSVC; that toolset is selected by native/build.bat but the runner image is not pinned by digest. The Debian image runs the unit tests. The headers come from the AsaApi commit pinned here and AsaApi.lib from the pinned release: the release's own headers are older than this game build. Depot 1004 is Valve's redistributable depot, listed by the server app."
